# 水站桶押金流转API测试示例
# 基础URL: http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 获取客户列表
GET http://localhost:3000/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. 创建客户
POST http://localhost:3000/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试客户",
  "phone": "13900139001",
  "address": "测试地址"
}

### 4. 获取库存桶列表
GET http://localhost:3000/api/buckets?status=in_stock
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. 正常创建配送单（核心流程1）
# 请先获取一个客户ID并替换下面的customer_id
POST http://localhost:3000/api/delivery-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID",
  "bucket_count": 2,
  "deposit_amount": 100,
  "delivery_address": "新的配送地址",
  "order_no": "DO20240115001",
  "created_by": "操作员A",
  "remark": "首次配送"
}

### 6. 重复提交同一单号（测试拦截功能）
POST http://localhost:3000/api/delivery-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID",
  "bucket_count": 2,
  "deposit_amount": 100,
  "order_no": "DO20240115001",
  "created_by": "操作员A"
}

### 7. 查看异常日志
GET http://localhost:3000/api/exceptions
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. 获取单个客户详情
# 请替换为实际的客户ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/customers/REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. 创建退桶记录（核心流程2）
# 请先获取在用的桶编号
POST http://localhost:3000/api/return-records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID",
  "bucket_nos": ["A0001", "A0002"],
  "deduction_amount": 0,
  "deduction_reason": "",
  "operator": "操作员B",
  "remark": "正常退桶"
}

### 10. 异常场景：退桶时可用押金不足
# 先创建一个大金额的配送单，然后尝试退款超过押金的金额
POST http://localhost:3000/api/return-records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID",
  "bucket_nos": ["A0003", "A0004"],
  "deduction_amount": 500,
  "operator": "操作员B"
}

### 11. 查看配送单状态历史
# 请替换为实际的配送单ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/status-history/delivery_order/REPLACE_WITH_ORDER_ID
Content-Type: application/json

### 12. 人工修正押金
# 请替换为实际的客户ID和异常ID（可选）
POST http://localhost:3000/api/manual-corrections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ID",
  "correction_type": "deposit",
  "after_value": 200,
  "reason": "系统计算错误，手动调整押金",
  "operator": "管理员",
  "related_exception_id": "REPLACE_WITH_EXCEPTION_ID"
}

### 13. 获取押金报表
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

### 14. 导出押金报表CSV
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/deposit/export
Content-Type: application/json

### 15. 导出客户报表
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/customers/export
Content-Type: application/json

### 16. 导出异常日志
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reports/exceptions/export
Content-Type: application/json

### 17. 下载导出的文件
# 请替换为实际的文件名
GET http://localhost:3000/api/exports/deposit_report_2024-01-15T00-00-00.000Z.csv
